-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800 rounded-full\\\">\\n        40+ READY-TO-USE BUTTONS\\n      </span>\\n      <h1 class=\\\"text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight\\\">Tailwind Button Design System</h1>\\n      <p class=\\\"text-slate-400 max-w-xl mx-auto text-sm sm:text-base\\\">\\n        Modern SaaS, Cyberpunk, 3D, Neo-Brutalism, Luxury Gold, Animated Borders, and Micro-interactions.\\n      </p>\\n    </header>\\n\\n\\n    <!-- SECTION 1: MODERN SAAS & SHIMMERS -->\\n    <section class=\\\"bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500\\\"></span> 1. Modern SaaS & Shimmer\\n      </h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-5\\\">\\n        \\n        <!-- Linear Shimmer Light Beam -->\\n        <button class=\\\"relative group overflow-hidden rounded-xl bg-slate-950 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 border border-slate-800\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute inset-0 -translate-x-full bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/20 to-transparent transition-transform duration-700 ease-out group-hover:translate-x-full\\\"></span>\\n          <span>Linear Shimmer</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Radial Glow Hover -->\\n        <button class=\\\"relative group rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(37,99,235,0.3)] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-blue-500 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(37,99,235,0.7)] active:scale-95\\\">\\n          Radial Glow\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Spotlight Border -->\\n        <button class=\\\"relative rounded-xl p-[1px] font-semibold transition-all duration-300 group hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(99,102,241,0.5)]\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-500 via-purple-500 to-pink-500 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 opacity-70 group-hover:opacity-100\\\"></div>\\n          <div class=\\\"relative px-5 py-3 bg-slate-950 rounded-[11px] text-xs text-white\\\">Gradient Border</div>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Subtle Clean SaaS -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl bg-white text-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold shadow-sm transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-slate-200 active:scale-95\\\">\\n          Crisp Ghost White\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Rotating Conic Glow -->\\n        <button class=\\\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl p-[1px] group\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute inset-[-1000%] animate-spin-slow bg-[conic-gradient(from_90deg_at_50%_50%,#E2E8F0_0%,#3b82f6_50%,#E2E8F0_100%)]\\\"></span>\\n          <span class=\\\"relative block px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 text-xs font-semibold text-white\\\">Rotating Beam</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Indigo Pulse Glow -->\\n        <button class=\\\"relative rounded-xl bg-indigo-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:bg-indigo-500 hover:ring-4 hover:ring-indigo-500/30 active:scale-95\\\">\\n          Focus Pulse\\n        </button>\\n\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n\\n    <!-- SECTION 2: CYBERPUNK & DARK TECH -->\\n    <section class=\\\"bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-cyan-400\\\"></span> 2. Cyberpunk & Sci-Fi Tech\\n      </h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-5\\\">\\n\\n        <!-- Neon Cyan Radar -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-cyan-500/50 bg-[#0B132B] px-4 py-3 mono text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-cyan-400 transition-all hover:border-cyan-400 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(6,182,212,0.4)]\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-ping\\\"></span>\\n          Radar Ping\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Matrix Glitch Green -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group relative rounded-md border border-emerald-500/80 bg-black px-4 py-3 mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-400 transition-all hover:bg-emerald-500 hover:text-black hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(16,185,129,0.8)]\\\">\\n          Terminal Run\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Cut-Corner Cyberpunk -->\\n        <button class=\\\"relative bg-yellow-400 px-5 py-3 font-mono text-xs font-black uppercase text-black hover:bg-yellow-300 transition-all [clip-path:polygon(0_0,calc(100%-12px)_0,100_12px,100_100,12px_100,0_calc(100%-12px))]\\\">\\n          Chamfer Cut\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Neon Purple Wireframe -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-lg border-2 border-fuchsia-500 bg-transparent px-4 py-3 mono text-xs font-bold text-fuchsia-400 transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-fuchsia-500/20 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(217,70,239,0.5)]\\\">\\n          Neon Wire\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Overclocked Red Alert -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-lg bg-red-950/60 border border-red-500/60 px-4 py-3 mono text-xs uppercase text-red-400 transition-all hover:bg-red-600 hover:text-white hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(239,68,68,0.7)]\\\">\\n          Danger Overclock\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Monospace Bracket Hover -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group mono text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-cyan-400 py-3 transition-colors\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"group-hover:-translate-x-1 inline-block transition-transform\\\">[</span> Tech Brackets <span class=\\\"group-hover:translate-x-1 inline-block transition-transform\\\">]</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n\\n    <!-- SECTION 3: NEO-BRUTALIST & POP -->\\n    <section class=\\\"bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-400\\\"></span> 3. Neo-Brutalism & High Contrast\\n      </h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-5\\\">\\n\\n        <!-- Pop Yellow Drop -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl border-2 border-black bg-[#FFE66D] px-4 py-3 text-xs font-black text-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000] transition-all hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0px_#000] active:translate-x-1 active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Pop Yellow\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Mint Offset -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl border-2 border-black bg-[#6EE7B7] px-4 py-3 text-xs font-black text-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000] transition-all hover:-translate-x-0.5 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[6px_6px_0px_#000] active:translate-x-1 active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Mint Push\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Coral Tilt -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl border-2 border-black bg-[#FF8080] px-4 py-3 text-xs font-black text-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000] transition-all hover:rotate-2 hover:scale-105 active:rotate-0\\\">\\n          Coral Tilt\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Violet Thick Outline -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl border-2 border-black bg-[#C4B5FD] px-4 py-3 text-xs font-black text-black shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#000] transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_0px_#000] active:translate-y-0 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Violet Lift\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Monochrome Invert -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-none border-2 border-white bg-black px-4 py-3 text-xs font-black uppercase text-white shadow-[4px_4px_0px_#fff] transition-all hover:bg-white hover:text-black\\\">\\n          Hard Invert\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Pill Pop -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-full border-2 border-black bg-[#FCA5A5] px-4 py-3 text-xs font-black text-black shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#000] transition-all hover:shadow-[5px_5px_0px_#000] active:translate-x-0.5 active:translate-y-0.5\\\">\\n          Pill Brutal\\n        </button>\\n\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n\\n    <!-- SECTION 4: 3D SKEUOMORPHIC & TACTILE -->\\n    <section class=\\\"bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400\\\"></span> 4. 3D Skeuomorphic & Tactile Press\\n      </h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-5\\\">\\n\\n        <!-- 3D Game Push Blue -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-[0_6px_0_#1d4ed8] transition-all duration-150 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_7px_0_#1d4ed8] active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Push Button\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- 3D Ruby Red -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl bg-rose-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-[0_6px_0_#be123c] transition-all duration-150 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_7px_0_#be123c] active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Ruby Slab\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Emerald Bevel -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl bg-emerald-500 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-[0_6px_0_#047857] transition-all duration-150 active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Mint 3D\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Dark Neumorphic Inset -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl bg-slate-900 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 shadow-[-5px_-5px_10px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),5px_5px_15px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] transition-all active:shadow-[inset_-2px_-2px_5px_rgba(255,255,255,0.05),inset_2px_2px_5px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)]\\\">\\n          Neumorphic\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Pill Joystick -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-full bg-slate-800 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300 shadow-[0_4px_0_#0f172a] border border-slate-700 active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Joystick Pill\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Heavy Titanium -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-b from-slate-700 to-slate-900 border-t border-slate-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-slate-200 shadow-[0_6px_0_#020617] active:translate-y-1 active:shadow-none\\\">\\n          Titanium Bar\\n        </button>\\n\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n\\n    <!-- SECTION 5: LUXURY & EDITORIAL -->\\n    <section class=\\\"bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#E5C158]\\\"></span> 5. Luxury, Gold & Haute Couture\\n      </h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-5\\\">\\n\\n        <!-- Gold Foil Inset -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-none border border-[#D4AF37]/50 bg-black px-4 py-3 serif text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#E5C158] transition-all duration-500 hover:border-[#D4AF37] hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(212,175,55,0.3)]\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"relative z-10 transition duration-300 group-hover:text-white\\\">Gold Atelier</span>\\n          <div class=\\\"absolute inset-0 -translate-y-full bg-[#D4AF37]/20 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:translate-y-0\\\"></div>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Architectural Minimal Line -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group relative py-3 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase serif text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition-colors\\\">\\n          <span>Haute Minimal</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute bottom-1 left-0 h-[1px] w-0 bg-[#D4AF37] transition-all duration-500 group-hover:w-full\\\"></span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Velvet Night -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-gradient-to-b from-neutral-800 to-neutral-950 px-5 py-3 text-xs serif italic text-neutral-200 shadow-md transition-all duration-300 hover:border-white/50 hover:text-white\\\">\\n          Velvet Night\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Champagne Glow -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-lg bg-[#FAF0E6]/10 border border-[#FAF0E6]/30 px-5 py-3 text-xs serif tracking-wider uppercase text-[#FAF0E6] transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-[#FAF0E6] hover:text-black\\\">\\n          Champagne\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Monogram Badge -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-full border border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-950/20 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-serif tracking-widest text-amber-300 transition-all hover:border-amber-400 hover:bg-amber-900/30\\\">\\n          Royal Crest\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Dual Accent Line -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group flex items-center gap-2 border-y border-neutral-700 py-3 px-3 text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-300 transition-all hover:border-[#D4AF37] hover:text-[#D4AF37]\\\">\\n          <span>Runway</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"h-px w-4 bg-neutral-600 group-hover:w-8 group-hover:bg-[#D4AF37] transition-all duration-300\\\"></span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n\\n    <!-- SECTION 6: GLASSMORPHISM & BLUR -->\\n    <section class=\\\"bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-purple-400\\\"></span> 6. Glassmorphism & Liquid Blurs\\n      </h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-5\\\">\\n\\n        <!-- Frosted Frost Glass -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-white shadow-lg backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 hover:bg-white/20 hover:border-white/40 active:scale-95\\\">\\n          Frosted Glass\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Colored Aurora Glass -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-2xl border border-purple-500/30 bg-purple-500/15 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-purple-200 backdrop-blur-md transition-all hover:bg-purple-500/30 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(168,85,247,0.3)]\\\">\\n          Aurora Blur\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Liquid Gradient Animate -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 via-purple-500 to-indigo-500 animate-gradient px-5 py-3 text-xs font-bold text-white shadow-lg hover:scale-105 transition-transform active:scale-95\\\">\\n          Fluid Liquid\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Smoke Dark Glass -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl border border-slate-700/80 bg-slate-950/40 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 backdrop-blur-lg hover:border-slate-500 hover:text-white transition-all\\\">\\n          Smoked Obsidian\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Glowing Sheen Glass -->\\n        <button class=\\\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-medium text-white backdrop-blur-sm group\\\">\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/40 to-transparent\\\"></span>\\n          <span>Sheen Glass</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Ice Cyan Translucent -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-full border border-cyan-400/30 bg-cyan-500/10 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-cyan-300 backdrop-blur hover:bg-cyan-500/20 hover:border-cyan-400 transition-all\\\">\\n          Ice Capsule\\n        </button>\\n\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n\\n    <!-- SECTION 7: MICRO-INTERACTIONS & STATES -->\\n    <section class=\\\"bg-slate-800/40 border border-slate-700/60 rounded-3xl p-6 sm:p-8\\\">\\n      <h2 class=\\\"text-lg font-bold text-white mb-6 flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n        <span class=\\\"w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-400\\\"></span> 7. Micro-Interactions & Icons\\n      </h2>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-5\\\">\\n\\n        <!-- Magnetic Arrow Slide -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-slate-800 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition-all hover:bg-slate-700\\\">\\n          <span>Continue</span>\\n          <svg class=\\\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\">\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Loading Spinner State -->\\n        <button class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-blue-600 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-white opacity-90 cursor-wait\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"h-4 w-4 animate-spin text-white\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\">\\n            <circle class=\\\"opacity-25\\\" cx=\\\"12\\\" cy=\\\"12\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\"></circle>\\n            <path class=\\\"opacity-75\\\" fill=\\\"currentColor\\\" d=\\\"M4 12a8 8 0 018-8v8H4z\\\"></path>\\n          </svg>\\n          <span>Loading...</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Expand Circle Pill -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group relative flex items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-600 py-2.5 pl-4 pr-10 text-xs font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-300 hover:pr-4 hover:pl-10\\\">\\n          <span>Morph Pill</span>\\n          <span class=\\\"absolute right-2.5 h-6 w-6 rounded-full bg-emerald-800 flex items-center justify-center transition-all duration-300 group-hover:right-[calc(100%-2rem)]\\\">\\n            →\\n          </span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Download Bounce -->\\n        <button class=\\\"group inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl border border-slate-700 bg-slate-900 px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-200 hover:border-slate-500 hover:text-white\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"h-4 w-4 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-y-0.5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\">\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2\\\" d=\\\"M4 16v1a3 3 0 003 3h10a3 3 0 003-3v-1m-4-4l-4 4m0 0l-4-4m4 4V4\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n          <span>Download</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Success Checkmark Pop -->\\n        <button class=\\\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/60 px-4 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-400\\\">\\n          <svg class=\\\"h-4 w-4 text-emerald-400\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 24 24\\\" stroke=\\\"currentColor\\\">\\n            <path stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\" stroke-linejoin=\\\"round\\\" stroke-width=\\\"2.5\\\" d=\\\"M5 13l4 4L19 7\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n          <span>Confirmed</span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        <!-- Destructive Shake/Delete -->\\n        <button class=\\\"rounded-xl border border-rose-500/40 bg-rose-950/30 px-5 py-3 text-xs font-semibold text-rose-400 transition-all hover:bg-rose-600 hover:text-white hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(244,63,94,0.4)]\\\">\\n          Delete Account\\n        </button>\\n\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n  </div>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\" }} />\n  );\n}\n",
